{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01439",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 4.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.48,
      "end_seconds": 11.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.26,
      "end_seconds": 18.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.26,
      "end_seconds": 23.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.8,
      "end_seconds": 31.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a painful widespread rash. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.85,
      "end_seconds": 35.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.44,
      "end_seconds": 46.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.34,
      "end_seconds": 57.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.9,
      "end_seconds": 64.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Honestly, every other day. A four out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.4,
      "end_seconds": 68.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Alright, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.22,
      "end_seconds": 75.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a fever as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.53,
      "end_seconds": 84.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 84.29,
      "end_seconds": 89.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.22,
      "end_seconds": 92.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.63,
      "end_seconds": 101.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything. Has there been sore red eyes too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.4,
      "end_seconds": 105.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Well, yes, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.08,
      "end_seconds": 109.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Has there been sores in your mouth too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.69,
      "end_seconds": 112.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.67,
      "end_seconds": 116.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.51,
      "end_seconds": 125.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. The fever? That's been for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.33,
      "end_seconds": 132.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Have you had a painful widespread rash before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.48,
      "end_seconds": 141.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 143.38,
      "end_seconds": 152.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse is 97 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 95 percent, BP is 118 over 69. Temp 38.4 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.16,
      "end_seconds": 154.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.83,
      "end_seconds": 162.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Alright, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 165.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.81,
      "end_seconds": 168.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.37,
      "end_seconds": 184.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "There are dusky red patches with blistering and the skin peels when I rub it lightly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.99,
      "end_seconds": 195.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Please sit back down. A few quick ones: insect bite or new medicine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.78,
      "end_seconds": 205.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I haven't had insect bite or new medicine, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.79,
      "end_seconds": 211.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.82,
      "end_seconds": 215.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.61,
      "end_seconds": 225.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.97,
      "end_seconds": 229.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.64,
      "end_seconds": 232.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.0,
      "end_seconds": 235.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.42,
      "end_seconds": 239.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 241.26,
      "end_seconds": 251.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "He is on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day, I give it to him. It's fluoxetine, 20 milligrams, every morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.78,
      "end_seconds": 256.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Yeah, I used to take mirtazapine, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.08,
      "end_seconds": 261.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.64,
      "end_seconds": 267.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis. My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.44,
      "end_seconds": 285.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.41,
      "end_seconds": 300.25,
      "duration_seconds": 12.84,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I gave up cigarettes last spring. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.62,
      "end_seconds": 312.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.21,
      "end_seconds": 318.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for nearly five years. Depression, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.9,
      "end_seconds": 330.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Okay, I can see anxiety and depression in your file as well. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.5,
      "end_seconds": 335.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.5,
      "end_seconds": 345.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. The most likely explanation is a severe drug reaction of the skin. We shouldn't forget a viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.05,
      "end_seconds": 350.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.29,
      "end_seconds": 387.46,
      "duration_seconds": 36.17,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a severe drug reaction of the skin, but I'd like to confirm. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for severe drug reaction. An urgent dermatology review is what I'd like next, for severe drug reaction. Stop the antibiotic now and I am sending you to hospital immediately. The dermatology team would be the right next step, I'll refer you. Let's review you straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.68,
      "end_seconds": 390.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.46,
      "end_seconds": 397.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.39,
      "end_seconds": 403.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.15,
      "end_seconds": 410.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Okay, yes, exactly right. Okay, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.86,
      "end_seconds": 413.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.92,
      "end_seconds": 415.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}